{"id":234,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"少人数で自分発見する帝京大学附属","feature_description":"帝京大学中学校・高等学校は、少人数教育を最大の特色として、一人ひとりと向き合う学習指導を行う学校です。中高一貫システムでは自分発見のプログラムを通して、基礎学力だけでなく体験を通じた思考力や価値観を育てています。教育方針・学習指導・進路指導が一体で整理され、学校生活の全体像をつかみやすい構成です。進路実績や教育環境も公式にまとめられています。","clubs":[{"id":5041,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.teikyo-u.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5042,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.teikyo-u.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5043,"name":"中国拳法部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.teikyo-u.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5044,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.teikyo-u.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5045,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.teikyo-u.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5046,"name":"競技かるた部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.teikyo-u.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5047,"name":"写真部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.teikyo-u.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5048,"name":"文芸部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.teikyo-u.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5049,"name":"南米音楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.teikyo-u.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5050,"name":"天文気象部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.teikyo-u.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5051,"name":"映画研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.teikyo-u.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5052,"name":"社会研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.teikyo-u.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5053,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.teikyo-u.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":50